(2246854, 307940, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  If it were me picking ribbons. ..I''d give one to this image!  This is beautiful!  Captured perfectly with just the right amount of light on the bird to give it a striking night time look.  Good luck.  10</td>', 'Wow!!!  If it were me picking ribbons. ..I''d give one to this image!  This is beautiful!  Captured perfectly with just the right amount of light on the bird to give it a striking night time look.  Good luck.  10', '2006-03-22 07:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
