(2246929, 309581, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ack, where''s the water?<br/> <br/>The background is great for low-key. The foreground is uhmm.... hrm.<br/> <br/>Sorry. (this is not a 1)</td>', 'Ack, where''s the water? The background is great for low-key. The foreground is uhmm.... hrm. Sorry. (this is not a 1)', '2006-03-22 10:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246961, 309304, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2006-03-22 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246965, 308411, 53517, '<td valign="top">Image is offcenter and slightly off horizontal. Good capture, but your image would be much stronger if you crop out all the extra black and straighten next time.</td>', 'Image is offcenter and slightly off horizontal. Good capture, but your image would be much stronger if you crop out all the extra black and straighten next time.', '2006-03-22 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246966, 309842, 16402, '<td valign="top">Certainly low-key. Nice graduated tone. Reflection on glass is a bit distracting. It looks like it might be a fire, if so I''d have either included a bit more of the reflection or eliminated it all together. I''d have also cropped it a bit tighter. Nice job.</td>', 'Certainly low-key. Nice graduated tone. Reflection on glass is a bit distracting. It looks like it might be a fire, if so I''d have either included a bit more of the reflection or eliminated it all together. I''d have also cropped it a bit tighter. Nice job.', '2006-03-22 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246969, 309403, 53517, '<td valign="top">Image would be stronger if you cropped the image closer to the figure or taken it from the portrait view.</td>', 'Image would be stronger if you cropped the image closer to the figure or taken it from the portrait view.', '2006-03-22 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246972, 309596, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice color and sharpness. Might have cropped the top a bit tighter.</td>', 'Nice color and sharpness. Might have cropped the top a bit tighter.', '2006-03-22 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246979, 308706, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cool approach and good execution. Can''t really find much I''d change.</td>', 'Cool approach and good execution. Can''t really find much I''d change.', '2006-03-22 11:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246986, 308099, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot with great patterns and textures. Wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Really nice shot with great patterns and textures. Wouldn''t change a thing.', '2006-03-22 11:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246991, 307195, 16402, '<td valign="top">Not too bad a portrait but not that low-key, very heavy on mid-tones. Also, DOF seem TOO small for me, with one eye sharply in focus but the other a bit off.</td>', 'Not too bad a portrait but not that low-key, very heavy on mid-tones. Also, DOF seem TOO small for me, with one eye sharply in focus but the other a bit off.', '2006-03-22 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246995, 309087, 16402, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t qualify as low-key. It''s a bit dim but not "mostly dark." There are certainly many more mid- and light-tones than dark-tones. Composition is a little boring as well.</td>', 'This really doesn''t qualify as low-key. It''s a bit dim but not "mostly dark." There are certainly many more mid- and light-tones than dark-tones. Composition is a little boring as well.', '2006-03-22 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2246999, 309465, 28710, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. The way you have lit the head from one source and the body from the other source gives a bit of lop-sided, nearly disembodied look.<br/> <br/>Cool.</td>', 'Interesting effect. The way you have lit the head from one source and the body from the other source gives a bit of lop-sided, nearly disembodied look. Cool.', '2006-03-22 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247000, 309770, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject with realy nice composition, good low-key exposure and focus. I''d like to see it in B&amp;W to compare.</td>', 'Very interesting subject with realy nice composition, good low-key exposure and focus. I''d like to see it in B&W to compare.', '2006-03-22 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247003, 308277, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Good composition, focus, everything.</td>', 'Really nice shot. Good composition, focus, everything.', '2006-03-22 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247004, 306999, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I will be honest, after some studying I realised this was a broach or necklace of some sort, however initially when this image loaded it looked like a load of dried puke.. sorry..   (3)</td>', 'OK, I will be honest, after some studying I realised this was a broach or necklace of some sort, however initially when this image loaded it looked like a load of dried puke.. sorry..   (3)', '2006-03-22 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247013, 307371, 3746, '<td valign="top">uninspiring. flat, doesnt really meet the challenge this week. keep trying though!  (3)</td>', 'uninspiring. flat, doesnt really meet the challenge this week. keep trying though!  (3)', '2006-03-22 11:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247014, 309792, 28710, '<td valign="top">A little bit heavy on the darkness here. It looks interesting, but I can''t actually see anything. It looks to me like the window of a small boat in the dark with a person''s face inside a gently lit cabin. The person''s face looks fearful.<br/> <br/>I have absolutely no idea if this is correct or not though because there is not enough detail.<br/> <br/>If you had cropped in to a square crop or perhaps slightly more landscapish, maybe there would be a bit more detail visible in the face. <br/> <br/>There also appears to be some other things in the shadow, but I can''t make any of it out, it almost looks like a bat wing or something?<br/> <br/>I have my monitor calibrated and at max brightness.<br/> <br/>Sorry. (not a 1)</td>', 'A little bit heavy on the darkness here. It looks interesting, but I can''t actually see anything. It looks to me like the window of a small boat in the dark with a person''s face inside a gently lit cabin. The person''s face looks fearful. I have absolutely no idea if this is correct or not though because there is not enough detail. If you had cropped in to a square crop or perhaps slightly more landscapish, maybe there would be a bit more detail visible in the face.  There also appears to be some other things in the shadow, but I can''t make any of it out, it almost looks like a bat wing or something? I have my monitor calibrated and at max brightness. Sorry. (not a 1)', '2006-03-22 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247018, 307685, 3746, '<td valign="top">tad boring, bit blurry, very uninspiring.. dont give up though! (3)</td>', 'tad boring, bit blurry, very uninspiring.. dont give up though! (3)', '2006-03-22 11:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247019, 309356, 3746, '<td valign="top">nice, one of the better images in this challenge.. (7)</td>', 'nice, one of the better images in this challenge.. (7)', '2006-03-22 11:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247020, 307715, 3746, '<td valign="top">I have to admit this is VERY eyecatching when looking at the thumbnails. not quite as good at this size, but unique in the challenge.. (7)</td>', 'I have to admit this is VERY eyecatching when looking at the thumbnails. not quite as good at this size, but unique in the challenge.. (7)', '2006-03-22 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1);
