(2247035, 308671, 16402, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely! Exposure is great and certainly low-key. Focus is sharp and composition is nice.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely! Exposure is great and certainly low-key. Focus is sharp and composition is nice.', '2006-03-22 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247037, 309169, 3746, '<td valign="top">nice spot on the forehead. will give it a 7 just for that ... (joke)..</td>', 'nice spot on the forehead. will give it a 7 just for that ... (joke)..', '2006-03-22 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247038, 309616, 28710, '<td valign="top">Not exactly low key, but I will say that this would be much better with that flash glare on the left cropped out. I''m happy with the square crop on some of my pictures. This might be slightly improved that way.</td>', 'Not exactly low key, but I will say that this would be much better with that flash glare on the left cropped out. I''m happy with the square crop on some of my pictures. This might be slightly improved that way.', '2006-03-22 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247040, 308531, 3746, '<td valign="top">this doesnt look low key, just looks like a poorly lit family shot.. nice idea though.</td>', 'this doesnt look low key, just looks like a poorly lit family shot.. nice idea though.', '2006-03-22 11:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247044, 309798, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice job but DOF is a bit too tight to me. I''d like to see a bit more of the detail in sharp focus. I realize you were putting the emphasis on the bear for the title, but I think people would have still gotten it without such tight DOF.</td>', 'Nice job but DOF is a bit too tight to me. I''d like to see a bit more of the detail in sharp focus. I realize you were putting the emphasis on the bear for the title, but I think people would have still gotten it without such tight DOF.', '2006-03-22 11:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247046, 308917, 40370, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective from the street level, love the curb and people on one side and the cars on the other. I am new to "low-key", not sure if neon fits the bill, as I justed started voting, I''ll have to check the other entries and come back to this, I love it though.</td>', 'Awesome perspective from the street level, love the curb and people on one side and the cars on the other. I am new to "low-key", not sure if neon fits the bill, as I justed started voting, I''ll have to check the other entries and come back to this, I love it though.', '2006-03-22 11:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247047, 309254, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty funky little picture. What a great face and moustache!<br/> <br/>Light''s a tiny bit harsh on the left. I don''t care.<br/> <br/>I like that you made a small attempt to include a little bit of dimension on the dark side of the face. That''s personal taste, and honestly, I would have liked the tiniest bit more (maybe 5-20 bit depth at the most)</td>', 'This is a pretty funky little picture. What a great face and moustache! Light''s a tiny bit harsh on the left. I don''t care. I like that you made a small attempt to include a little bit of dimension on the dark side of the face. That''s personal taste, and honestly, I would have liked the tiniest bit more (maybe 5-20 bit depth at the most)', '2006-03-22 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247049, 309867, 40370, '<td valign="top">Interesting rainbow around your burst of light, I like the reflections at the bottom of the glass but find the spots on the top portion distracting, maybe over-sharpened?</td>', 'Interesting rainbow around your burst of light, I like the reflections at the bottom of the glass but find the spots on the top portion distracting, maybe over-sharpened?', '2006-03-22 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247056, 309883, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. Might have cropped left side just a bit more.</td>', 'Nice effort. Might have cropped left side just a bit more.', '2006-03-22 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247061, 307600, 32609, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture and awesome connection to the challenge topic! I think I would like the shot more if I didn''t see the wooden end but I understand it is the lowest key. :)</td>', 'Awesome picture and awesome connection to the challenge topic! I think I would like the shot more if I didn''t see the wooden end but I understand it is the lowest key. :)', '2006-03-22 11:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
