(2247080, 309719, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice try... what makes a good low key image is its tonality on the shadow side of the histogram... unfortunately yours has no tonality whatsoever.</td>', 'Nice try... what makes a good low key image is its tonality on the shadow side of the histogram... unfortunately yours has no tonality whatsoever.', '2006-03-22 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247081, 308938, 28710, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but this looks like a really well-done hand-made model.<br/> <br/>Is that sawdust on the seat?<br/> <br/>Beautiful craftsmanship btw. My dad tried to build a 3 masted schooner when he was younger out of mahoganny he scooped from crate pallettes (which 35 years ago were often made of better wood than the pine we see today). He only ever got about 1/3 of the way finished, but it''s really marvelous to see true craftsmanship.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but this looks like a really well-done hand-made model. Is that sawdust on the seat? Beautiful craftsmanship btw. My dad tried to build a 3 masted schooner when he was younger out of mahoganny he scooped from crate pallettes (which 35 years ago were often made of better wood than the pine we see today). He only ever got about 1/3 of the way finished, but it''s really marvelous to see true craftsmanship.', '2006-03-22 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247094, 308906, 32609, '<td valign="top">I know you will have 5 other people tell you this isn''t low key. Sorry for the repetition!</td>', 'I know you will have 5 other people tell you this isn''t low key. Sorry for the repetition!', '2006-03-22 12:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247097, 309923, 32609, '<td valign="top">I definitely see the concentration. Good low key shot.</td>', 'I definitely see the concentration. Good low key shot.', '2006-03-22 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247099, 309451, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft light on her face.  I like that we can see both eyes, although the near side of her face is very shadowed.  I like the touch of light on her cheek, too.  Wonderful job keeping shadow detail in her hair.  Her bare arm in the lower right hand corner is distracting to me.  It would have been better to cover it.  I think that a tighter crop, with a not so centered compostiion woould be stronger; I would take off some of the spacwe above and to the left of her.  WIthout the basic editing restrictions, I would suggest burning down her chest a little, it is brighter than her face.  Although I like the lines of her neckline, covering more of the skin on her chest would make the face a stronger part of the image. 7 from me.</td>', 'Very nice soft light on her face.  I like that we can see both eyes, although the near side of her face is very shadowed.  I like the touch of light on her cheek, too.  Wonderful job keeping shadow detail in her hair.  Her bare arm in the lower right hand corner is distracting to me.  It would have been better to cover it.  I think that a tighter crop, with a not so centered compostiion woould be stronger; I would take off some of the spacwe above and to the left of her.  WIthout the basic editing restrictions, I would suggest burning down her chest a little, it is brighter than her face.  Although I like the lines of her neckline, covering more of the skin on her chest would make the face a stronger part of the image. 7 from me.', '2006-03-22 12:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247102, 309345, 32609, '<td valign="top">Cool ripple simulation.</td>', 'Cool ripple simulation.', '2006-03-22 12:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247103, 308671, 32609, '<td valign="top">This might not hit "low key" for everyone but I still like it. Good colors and cool boats.</td>', 'This might not hit "low key" for everyone but I still like it. Good colors and cool boats.', '2006-03-22 12:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247104, 309649, 28710, '<td valign="top">Very nice profile. It might have been nice to see the clouds drop into real darkness, which would have made it more low-key and would have rendered that annoying power line invisible.<br/> <br/>It''s a really great picture.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah, and don''t forget that the largest side can be 640 pixels, yours is 514x350.</td>', 'Very nice profile. It might have been nice to see the clouds drop into real darkness, which would have made it more low-key and would have rendered that annoying power line invisible. It''s a really great picture. Oh yeah, and don''t forget that the largest side can be 640 pixels, yours is 514x350.', '2006-03-22 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247112, 308618, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful keys</td>', 'beautiful keys', '2006-03-22 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247114, 307052, 28710, '<td valign="top">Please remember that there''s no text allowed in photos. And you can get better impact if you make sure that the greatest side is 640 pixels. Yours is 438x359.<br/> <br/>Photographically, the colors here are ineteresting, but the composition is a bit dull. There''s water on the third, but it''s not stopped in motion or otherwise captured in any pleasing way. <br/> <br/>Your light seems fairly well balanced and the lines seem laid out pretty well too.</td>', 'Please remember that there''s no text allowed in photos. And you can get better impact if you make sure that the greatest side is 640 pixels. Yours is 438x359. Photographically, the colors here are ineteresting, but the composition is a bit dull. There''s water on the third, but it''s not stopped in motion or otherwise captured in any pleasing way.  Your light seems fairly well balanced and the lines seem laid out pretty well too.', '2006-03-22 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247115, 309228, 15204, '<td valign="top">Well done keeing so much details in your shadows.  The lighting looks nice and soft.  I think it needs more contrast/brighter highlights, though, even though it is low key.  Your lighting is very well placed, IMO it would still be low key if you brought the highlights up, and it would have more impact.  I wish there were a catchlight in her right eye, too, since it is the side that the light is coming from.  Nice expressiong that you have captured.</td>', 'Well done keeing so much details in your shadows.  The lighting looks nice and soft.  I think it needs more contrast/brighter highlights, though, even though it is low key.  Your lighting is very well placed, IMO it would still be low key if you brought the highlights up, and it would have more impact.  I wish there were a catchlight in her right eye, too, since it is the side that the light is coming from.  Nice expressiong that you have captured.', '2006-03-22 12:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247116, 307771, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice tonality in this low key composition. Never heard of a camera called a "Kiev". I thought that was a city in Ukraine. ;)</td>', 'Nice tonality in this low key composition. Never heard of a camera called a "Kiev". I thought that was a city in Ukraine. ;)', '2006-03-22 12:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
