(2247139, 308061, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture of a violin, one of my favorite instruments.<br/> <br/>A violin is both a thing of beauty to behold and to listen to.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure about the low-key. I wonder if perhaps you might have been thinking of a dual meaning for low-key, but in that case, a violincello or bass would be better. Perhaps even a Viola, but would I really be able to tell a Violin from a Viola after all of these years? Might fly over the heads of all but the most musically inclined viewers.</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture of a violin, one of my favorite instruments. A violin is both a thing of beauty to behold and to listen to. I''m not sure about the low-key. I wonder if perhaps you might have been thinking of a dual meaning for low-key, but in that case, a violincello or bass would be better. Perhaps even a Viola, but would I really be able to tell a Violin from a Viola after all of these years? Might fly over the heads of all but the most musically inclined viewers.', '2006-03-22 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247142, 309306, 16402, '<td valign="top">Pushing the too low-key envelope for me. Bit too much dead spaces lacking any detail.</td>', 'Pushing the too low-key envelope for me. Bit too much dead spaces lacking any detail.', '2006-03-22 12:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
