(2247459, 307432, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I really like the reflections.  Better than your regular bird and pond shots.  May have been cropped a bit tighter. 7 good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting.  I really like the reflections.  Better than your regular bird and pond shots.  May have been cropped a bit tighter. 7 good luck in the challenge!', '2006-03-22 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247466, 309306, 52472, '<td valign="top">A hard side lighting would have made it much more dramatic, IMHO</td>', 'A hard side lighting would have made it much more dramatic, IMHO', '2006-03-22 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247477, 309581, 34192, '<td valign="top">In low key shots, the object is to find the perfect point at which there is just enough light to hold the viewers interest.  For me, this image just misses.  The foreground is too bright, not allowing me past it into the background.  If there had been just a little more light in the background, the image would have overcome this issue and my curiousity would have been piqued; I would have wanted to go deeper into the image.  The colors are interesting - they do hild my attention.  But they overpower the rest of the image and leave me thinking it would have been better to crop the top. 5 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'In low key shots, the object is to find the perfect point at which there is just enough light to hold the viewers interest.  For me, this image just misses.  The foreground is too bright, not allowing me past it into the background.  If there had been just a little more light in the background, the image would have overcome this issue and my curiousity would have been piqued; I would have wanted to go deeper into the image.  The colors are interesting - they do hild my attention.  But they overpower the rest of the image and leave me thinking it would have been better to crop the top. 5 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-03-22 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247481, 309592, 52472, '<td valign="top">Not very low key, but a fantastic picture nevertheless!</td>', 'Not very low key, but a fantastic picture nevertheless!', '2006-03-22 14:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247491, 309670, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find the border distracting in this image, if only because it tries to hold me in.  In this image, I''d rather believe there is unlimited space around the flower.  The colors are well rendered.  The composition conforms to the rule of thirds but there is still a static-ness to the image; for me this might be due to the abrupt cutting off of the bottom due to the border.  As a low key entry, I think this image misses the challenge.  The lighting is quite bright on the subject even if the background is black.  Outside the challenge a well taken image for stock type photography. 5</td>', 'I find the border distracting in this image, if only because it tries to hold me in.  In this image, I''d rather believe there is unlimited space around the flower.  The colors are well rendered.  The composition conforms to the rule of thirds but there is still a static-ness to the image; for me this might be due to the abrupt cutting off of the bottom due to the border.  As a low key entry, I think this image misses the challenge.  The lighting is quite bright on the subject even if the background is black.  Outside the challenge a well taken image for stock type photography. 5', '2006-03-22 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2247499, 309263, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the simple lighting and tones of this.  Excellent image for the challenge.  Overall, I think something is missing but I can''t at this time put my finger on it.  I will revisit...7</td>', 'I love the simple lighting and tones of this.  Excellent image for the challenge.  Overall, I think something is missing but I can''t at this time put my finger on it.  I will revisit...7', '2006-03-22 14:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
