(2247641, 308679, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I saw this in the thumbnails and was looking forward to rating it.. HOWEVER.. This really is a missed opportunity. The slight blurriness (low shutter speed due to low light?) really detracts from the overall `feel` of the photo. I am so gutted for you in that respect otherwise this, in my opinion, would of been in the top 3, you may be lucky and others like me will see how good this photo `could` of been. I still think its great, I love the crop, the subject matter and the lighting and hence will give you an 8...<br/>Looking at this again I think most people will rate this as a 10, then detract a couple of points.. this could be a winner. I wouldnt be surprised if I saw this in the top 3 come next wednesday.</td>', 'OK, I saw this in the thumbnails and was looking forward to rating it.. HOWEVER.. This really is a missed opportunity. The slight blurriness (low shutter speed due to low light?) really detracts from the overall `feel` of the photo. I am so gutted for you in that respect otherwise this, in my opinion, would of been in the top 3, you may be lucky and others like me will see how good this photo `could` of been. I still think its great, I love the crop, the subject matter and the lighting and hence will give you an 8...Looking at this again I think most people will rate this as a 10, then detract a couple of points.. this could be a winner. I wouldnt be surprised if I saw this in the top 3 come next wednesday.', '2006-03-22 15:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
