(2247781, 309263, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice still life. Cobwebs caught the light great and you can even pick up some texture in the wood.</td>', 'Nice still life. Cobwebs caught the light great and you can even pick up some texture in the wood.', '2006-03-22 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
