(2247783, 309927, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH GOD - this is excellent.  That touch of light on the head and the right 2 whiskers.  My only nit pick woul d be maybe "straighten" out that sense of tilt and rotate about 3 degrees right.  Otherwise - REALLY GOOD. 8</td>', 'OH GOD - this is excellent.  That touch of light on the head and the right 2 whiskers.  My only nit pick woul d be maybe "straighten" out that sense of tilt and rotate about 3 degrees right.  Otherwise - REALLY GOOD. 8', '2006-03-22 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
