(2249354, 309792, 54446, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is.  It meets the spirit of the challenge, but it fails to communicate.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is.  It meets the spirit of the challenge, but it fails to communicate.', '2006-03-22 21:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
