(2249703, 309719, 47020, '<td valign="top">So, the challenge asked for an image that was a "mostly dark image, with few highlights".  I imagine you''re just being contrary, but I don''t feel that the slight noise in your black here (which I don''t see with my eyes, but the computer tells me it''s there) really count.  :-P</td>', 'So, the challenge asked for an image that was a "mostly dark image, with few highlights".  I imagine you''re just being contrary, but I don''t feel that the slight noise in your black here (which I don''t see with my eyes, but the computer tells me it''s there) really count.  :-P', '2006-03-22 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249709, 309728, 47020, '<td valign="top">A little cropping (top and right) would, in my opinion, do wonders for this image...  I like the lighting and contrast and such, though.</td>', 'A little cropping (top and right) would, in my opinion, do wonders for this image...  I like the lighting and contrast and such, though.', '2006-03-22 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
