(2249841, 308528, 52115, '<td valign="top">this is a good example of low key in the reddish tones. I would''ve liked to see some more of the intricate wood detail. I have seen interesting driftwoods.</td>', 'this is a good example of low key in the reddish tones. I would''ve liked to see some more of the intricate wood detail. I have seen interesting driftwoods.', '2006-03-23 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
