(2252613, 309376, 41800, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Very nice DOF. I think it''s great that you put in a "pet type" picture since they seem to get voted down in most challenges. A feline fancier will definitely relate to the "look" more than the "dog" people. I may of cropped it so the eye was more "rule of third" to the bottom left and that would give a larger gazing area if possible. I would use this for a desk top if it were my cat. Good luck. 9</td>', 'Great capture. Very nice DOF. I think it''s great that you put in a "pet type" picture since they seem to get voted down in most challenges. A feline fancier will definitely relate to the "look" more than the "dog" people. I may of cropped it so the eye was more "rule of third" to the bottom left and that would give a larger gazing area if possible. I would use this for a desk top if it were my cat. Good luck. 9', '2006-03-23 20:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2252641, 309632, 41800, '<td valign="top">Crisp edges and great DOF. I wonder if it was possible to have the base of the blossom in one third and the nobby thing in the other third. Having more dark space in the upper right might give it a more reaching effect. Excellent job. good luck</td>', 'Crisp edges and great DOF. I wonder if it was possible to have the base of the blossom in one third and the nobby thing in the other third. Having more dark space in the upper right might give it a more reaching effect. Excellent job. good luck', '2006-03-23 20:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
