(2254356, 309719, 46119, '<td valign="top">I think the challenge states ... "Low key describes a mostly dark image, with few highlights" ... I see no highlights here ...</td>', 'I think the challenge states ... "Low key describes a mostly dark image, with few highlights" ... I see no highlights here ...', '2006-03-24 09:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254358, 309087, 46119, '<td valign="top">"Low key describes a mostly dark image, with few highlights" I think this may be stretching the "Mostly Dark" part of the challenge ...</td>', '"Low key describes a mostly dark image, with few highlights" I think this may be stretching the "Mostly Dark" part of the challenge ...', '2006-03-24 09:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254361, 309019, 46119, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines although I personally would have liked to have seen the window vertical. Nice imagery though.</td>', 'Very nice lines although I personally would have liked to have seen the window vertical. Nice imagery though.', '2006-03-24 09:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254365, 307451, 50674, '<td valign="top">rather nice, but you should try to submit a bigger photograph next time - there is an article in the help section, nice photograph, a bit on the dark side though and a shame it is so small.</td>', 'rather nice, but you should try to submit a bigger photograph next time - there is an article in the help section, nice photograph, a bit on the dark side though and a shame it is so small.', '2006-03-24 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254408, 309798, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, the lighting hasn''t brought out the beauty of this object. I can''t form an idea of what exactly it is. Perhaps a tighter frame on just the bear would have worked. There are hot spots in areas that don''t add to the frame.</td>', 'To me, the lighting hasn''t brought out the beauty of this object. I can''t form an idea of what exactly it is. Perhaps a tighter frame on just the bear would have worked. There are hot spots in areas that don''t add to the frame.', '2006-03-24 09:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254419, 308981, 11800, '<td valign="top">The darkness wasn''t used to the best advantage. The little house blends in with the trees and rocks and becomes a large mass. Maybe using a lower angle would have brought the house up into the sky for a better profile. The horizon is tilted a bit clockwise.</td>', 'The darkness wasn''t used to the best advantage. The little house blends in with the trees and rocks and becomes a large mass. Maybe using a lower angle would have brought the house up into the sky for a better profile. The horizon is tilted a bit clockwise.', '2006-03-24 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254430, 309151, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and I think the warm tone is very fitting to this image. The range of tones on the left makes it easy to see the hand and shell, but the right side is very confusing. I think it''s because of the wide band of dark placed against the small band of light on the hand.</td>', 'Good exposure and I think the warm tone is very fitting to this image. The range of tones on the left makes it easy to see the hand and shell, but the right side is very confusing. I think it''s because of the wide band of dark placed against the small band of light on the hand.', '2006-03-24 09:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254437, 309848, 16402, '<td valign="top">Too low-key (on my monitor at least).</td>', 'Too low-key (on my monitor at least).', '2006-03-24 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254438, 309599, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and interested subject choice.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and interested subject choice.', '2006-03-24 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254439, 309792, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, too low-key (on my monitor) to see enough to judge well.</td>', 'Sorry, too low-key (on my monitor) to see enough to judge well.', '2006-03-24 09:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254441, 309827, 16402, '<td valign="top">I really can''t find any suggestions/criticism to make. Great shot.</td>', 'I really can''t find any suggestions/criticism to make. Great shot.', '2006-03-24 09:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254442, 309890, 16402, '<td valign="top">Way too bright to qualify as low-key IMHO. White blinds make low-key hard to do. Maybe wooden blinds?</td>', 'Way too bright to qualify as low-key IMHO. White blinds make low-key hard to do. Maybe wooden blinds?', '2006-03-24 09:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254444, 309435, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lots of mid-tones here. Tiny bit less exposure would make it more low-key and still retain some shadow detail.</td>', 'Lots of mid-tones here. Tiny bit less exposure would make it more low-key and still retain some shadow detail.', '2006-03-24 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254448, 309918, 11800, '<td valign="top">The first time thru, I wondered how the rose seemed oof but now I think it''s because of the mirror. Thecnically, this is a dark picture and that is partially what low key is about. However, low key also is used to give a picture a "mood". I think that is what is missing in this picture. Composition wise, the yellow flower might have been brought out of the shadow or left out altogether.</td>', 'The first time thru, I wondered how the rose seemed oof but now I think it''s because of the mirror. Thecnically, this is a dark picture and that is partially what low key is about. However, low key also is used to give a picture a "mood". I think that is what is missing in this picture. Composition wise, the yellow flower might have been brought out of the shadow or left out altogether.', '2006-03-24 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254450, 308932, 16402, '<td valign="top">Exposure is pretty good, as is composition. Focus off just slightly?</td>', 'Exposure is pretty good, as is composition. Focus off just slightly?', '2006-03-24 09:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254465, 309337, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice enough portrait (exposure and focus are good) but not much "wow" factor. Just a good, low-key picture of a man.</td>', 'Nice enough portrait (exposure and focus are good) but not much "wow" factor. Just a good, low-key picture of a man.', '2006-03-24 10:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254471, 309881, 16402, '<td valign="top">Bit too low-key for me and way too much dead space at top.</td>', 'Bit too low-key for me and way too much dead space at top.', '2006-03-24 10:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254472, 309409, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt with interesting subject, but seems out of focus to me and I think I''d ahve made the borders yellow or orange to match picture.</td>', 'Nice attempt with interesting subject, but seems out of focus to me and I think I''d ahve made the borders yellow or orange to match picture.', '2006-03-24 10:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254476, 309679, 16402, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice low-key shot but needs to be cropped much tighter on the subject to eliminate all the dead space.</td>', 'This is a really nice low-key shot but needs to be cropped much tighter on the subject to eliminate all the dead space.', '2006-03-24 10:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254499, 309690, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the exposure. Can''t say I''m a fan of the puddle. Causes me to think of an accident. Sorry. That''s probably not what the intended reaction was supposed to be.</td>', 'Nice job on the exposure. Can''t say I''m a fan of the puddle. Causes me to think of an accident. Sorry. That''s probably not what the intended reaction was supposed to be.', '2006-03-24 10:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254506, 308907, 11800, '<td valign="top">low key is mostly about a mood. This picture does have a lot of dark pixels but the subject(the woman) is exposed normally, with none of the shadow play that makes low key so romantic.</td>', 'low key is mostly about a mood. This picture does have a lot of dark pixels but the subject(the woman) is exposed normally, with none of the shadow play that makes low key so romantic.', '2006-03-24 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254519, 309562, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, this lacks interest. It looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'To me, this lacks interest. It looks a bit oversharpened.', '2006-03-24 10:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254524, 308917, 34192, '<td valign="top">really like this image.  Like the DOF used. Composition well done.  There is a dynamic quality to this.  Things are cropped incompletely but that adds rather than detracts.  Very effective, colors well done.  9</td>', 'really like this image.  Like the DOF used. Composition well done.  There is a dynamic quality to this.  Things are cropped incompletely but that adds rather than detracts.  Very effective, colors well done.  9', '2006-03-24 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254525, 308107, 34192, '<td valign="top">Textures makes this image interesting.  Well done tonal range.</td>', 'Textures makes this image interesting.  Well done tonal range.', '2006-03-24 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254526, 308273, 34192, '<td valign="top">Really like the silhouette - works wonderfully.  Wondering if maybe the left and right sides were cropped if it would be a more powerful image. 7 good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Really like the silhouette - works wonderfully.  Wondering if maybe the left and right sides were cropped if it would be a more powerful image. 7 good luck in the challenge!', '2006-03-24 10:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254554, 309312, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors look off. I kept looking at this and wondering why I was resisting liking it. It is well exposed and nostrils don''t bother me as much as some other people, so that was ok. It''s the lack of any visual clues as to him being in a "bitter cold" environment. He actually looks warm and comfortable. <br/>I think this would be improved a lot as a duotone.</td>', 'The colors look off. I kept looking at this and wondering why I was resisting liking it. It is well exposed and nostrils don''t bother me as much as some other people, so that was ok. It''s the lack of any visual clues as to him being in a "bitter cold" environment. He actually looks warm and comfortable. I think this would be improved a lot as a duotone.', '2006-03-24 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254557, 309644, 34192, '<td valign="top">like the use of shadow and grain to evoke a mood.  Composition and depth of field add.  Tones well done. I was going to give you an 8.  I''m sitting here thinking, why not 9 or 10?  Is it the subject?  Is there something wrong with the image?  And the answer to both is no.  I don''t think it could be improved, I think its very evocative and tells a story.  Technically well done.  So a 10 it is.  And a favorite.</td>', 'like the use of shadow and grain to evoke a mood.  Composition and depth of field add.  Tones well done. I was going to give you an 8.  I''m sitting here thinking, why not 9 or 10?  Is it the subject?  Is there something wrong with the image?  And the answer to both is no.  I don''t think it could be improved, I think its very evocative and tells a story.  Technically well done.  So a 10 it is.  And a favorite.', '2006-03-24 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254558, 307309, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think if the light fell across the face this would be much better.</td>', 'I think if the light fell across the face this would be much better.', '2006-03-24 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254563, 307943, 34192, '<td valign="top">the lighting is perfect, the expressions tell a story, composition and focus and DOF spot on.  Slight tilt but it doesn''t detract. 9</td>', 'the lighting is perfect, the expressions tell a story, composition and focus and DOF spot on.  Slight tilt but it doesn''t detract. 9', '2006-03-24 10:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254566, 307877, 11800, '<td valign="top">I would like this much better if I could understand what it was. Not enough information for me to connect to it.</td>', 'I would like this much better if I could understand what it was. Not enough information for me to connect to it.', '2006-03-24 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254573, 309632, 34192, '<td valign="top">mapplethorpe.  First thing that popped into my head.  The lighting on this is excellent.  Makes the flower sensual.  Has a lot of movement.  I can see the petals unfurling while I comment.  I take a lot of flower shots ''cause there easy, convenient, and don''t argue. :)  This one is one I would love to call my own.  Excellent work. 10</td>', 'mapplethorpe.  First thing that popped into my head.  The lighting on this is excellent.  Makes the flower sensual.  Has a lot of movement.  I can see the petals unfurling while I comment.  I take a lot of flower shots ''cause there easy, convenient, and don''t argue. :)  This one is one I would love to call my own.  Excellent work. 10', '2006-03-24 10:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254574, 309075, 11800, '<td valign="top">It is low key as far as darkness goes but is it interesting?</td>', 'It is low key as far as darkness goes but is it interesting?', '2006-03-24 10:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254593, 308619, 11800, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting and most of the pixels in the frame are black. Black pixels alone do not make a good low key picture. I''d call this more high contrast. Your pixels within the area of interest are mostly light. This does have the potential to be low key, but there needs to be more tonality in the shadowed areas and less bright white.</td>', 'The composition is interesting and most of the pixels in the frame are black. Black pixels alone do not make a good low key picture. I''d call this more high contrast. Your pixels within the area of interest are mostly light. This does have the potential to be low key, but there needs to be more tonality in the shadowed areas and less bright white.', '2006-03-24 10:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254607, 309854, 11800, '<td valign="top">looks underexposed. I can''t tell what the object is.</td>', 'looks underexposed. I can''t tell what the object is.', '2006-03-24 11:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254629, 307195, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure for a portrait. It has the normal range of tones one would expect to see. In a low key portrait the shadows would be more pronounced, deeper, moodier, with the highlights creating the form of the face. Sorta just the opposite of this.</td>', 'Nice exposure for a portrait. It has the normal range of tones one would expect to see. In a low key portrait the shadows would be more pronounced, deeper, moodier, with the highlights creating the form of the face. Sorta just the opposite of this.', '2006-03-24 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254647, 309645, 11800, '<td valign="top">I know there''s a person behind there, but the curtain is in the way. I''d like it more if the face was between the two folds. I keep looking at whatever it is below the face. I don''t know what it is. The lightness within the darkness keeps drawing my eyes down there.</td>', 'I know there''s a person behind there, but the curtain is in the way. I''d like it more if the face was between the two folds. I keep looking at whatever it is below the face. I don''t know what it is. The lightness within the darkness keeps drawing my eyes down there.', '2006-03-24 11:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254655, 309746, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I have no idea what this is or what I am supposed to get from it.  There is no pattern or flow for my eyes to grab on to.  It is low key so it fits the challenge.  I think.</td>', 'Honestly, I have no idea what this is or what I am supposed to get from it.  There is no pattern or flow for my eyes to grab on to.  It is low key so it fits the challenge.  I think.', '2006-03-24 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254656, 309186, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors look dull.</td>', 'The colors look dull.', '2006-03-24 11:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254662, 307379, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the colors used but the slight blur doesn''t allow me to enjoy the image.</td>', 'I like the colors used but the slight blur doesn''t allow me to enjoy the image.', '2006-03-24 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254666, 309616, 34192, '<td valign="top">for me, this would be much improved without the noticible flash.  Having taken pictures in caves, I know how difficult it can be.  A good attempt.</td>', 'for me, this would be much improved without the noticible flash.  Having taken pictures in caves, I know how difficult it can be.  A good attempt.', '2006-03-24 11:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254669, 309845, 34192, '<td valign="top">blurry for my tastes but I like the use of shadow.</td>', 'blurry for my tastes but I like the use of shadow.', '2006-03-24 11:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254671, 309840, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t think low key lighting enhanced the scene. The pier becomes all jumbled in the darkness.</td>', 'I don''t think low key lighting enhanced the scene. The pier becomes all jumbled in the darkness.', '2006-03-24 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254672, 309708, 34192, '<td valign="top">interesting tree but not quite low key enough.  The bottom third could be cropped.  In a different challenge I would probably score a point higher.</td>', 'interesting tree but not quite low key enough.  The bottom third could be cropped.  In a different challenge I would probably score a point higher.', '2006-03-24 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254674, 307283, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the use of trees to ''frame'' the image.  They are more interesting than the bench.  The image seems tilted to the left.  Not quite low key enough.</td>', 'I like the use of trees to ''frame'' the image.  They are more interesting than the bench.  The image seems tilted to the left.  Not quite low key enough.', '2006-03-24 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254677, 309086, 34192, '<td valign="top">for me here, the battle is between softness and light.  A strengthening of one over the other would make this image more pleasing to my eye. i.e. more light or less soft.</td>', 'for me here, the battle is between softness and light.  A strengthening of one over the other would make this image more pleasing to my eye. i.e. more light or less soft.', '2006-03-24 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254682, 309792, 11800, '<td valign="top">Not enough info. To me low key doesn''t mean a black picture with 30 pixels of info. Why not just add a 305 pixel border?</td>', 'Not enough info. To me low key doesn''t mean a black picture with 30 pixels of info. Why not just add a 305 pixel border?', '2006-03-24 11:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254684, 309547, 28299, '<td valign="top">I wish I could give this an 11 - I love it (10)!!! Definitely the best example of low key in the challenge and a very interesting photo besides.</td>', 'I wish I could give this an 11 - I love it (10)!!! Definitely the best example of low key in the challenge and a very interesting photo besides.', '2006-03-24 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254685, 309452, 11800, '<td valign="top">Looks fuzzy and his/her beak is overexposed.</td>', 'Looks fuzzy and his/her beak is overexposed.', '2006-03-24 11:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254687, 309650, 28299, '<td valign="top">Love it - 10</td>', 'Love it - 10', '2006-03-24 11:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254688, 309632, 28299, '<td valign="top">Stunning, nice composition - 10</td>', 'Stunning, nice composition - 10', '2006-03-24 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254689, 309540, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great composition and tones - 10</td>', 'Great composition and tones - 10', '2006-03-24 11:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254690, 309263, 28299, '<td valign="top">Excellent! 10</td>', 'Excellent! 10', '2006-03-24 11:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254691, 308860, 28299, '<td valign="top">Very nice - 10</td>', 'Very nice - 10', '2006-03-24 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254712, 307432, 11800, '<td valign="top">Seems to have some color noise. I like the idea but would have liked the swans all really blured or more in focus.</td>', 'Seems to have some color noise. I like the idea but would have liked the swans all really blured or more in focus.', '2006-03-24 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254720, 308001, 3735, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!  I love it  9</td>', 'This is so beautiful!  I love it  9', '2006-03-24 11:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254731, 308874, 16402, '<td valign="top">Bit too low-key for my monitor but a good effort as far as I can tell.</td>', 'Bit too low-key for my monitor but a good effort as far as I can tell.', '2006-03-24 11:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254736, 309670, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty and well exposed. To me, low key isn''t just having a background that is dark. It''s about painting with shadows. This is a pretty picture but is not low key. Crop it down to the actual content &amp; you''ll find it''s a pretty normal distribution of tone, mostly middle to light.</td>', 'Pretty and well exposed. To me, low key isn''t just having a background that is dark. It''s about painting with shadows. This is a pretty picture but is not low key. Crop it down to the actual content & you''ll find it''s a pretty normal distribution of tone, mostly middle to light.', '2006-03-24 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254744, 308584, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better presented if the post was cropped out.</td>', 'I think this would have been better presented if the post was cropped out.', '2006-03-24 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254746, 309895, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Skin tone is great. My initial thought is that cropping the dead space at the left wouldn''t hurt the low-key feel of the photo at all, but I think it probably would compromise the composition.</td>', 'Very nice. Skin tone is great. My initial thought is that cropping the dead space at the left wouldn''t hurt the low-key feel of the photo at all, but I think it probably would compromise the composition.', '2006-03-24 12:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254747, 308953, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, this is more high contrast than low key. There is a large area that is extremely bright.</td>', 'To me, this is more high contrast than low key. There is a large area that is extremely bright.', '2006-03-24 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254766, 309609, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, the light areas don''t look right. They look dull and lack detail.</td>', 'To me, the light areas don''t look right. They look dull and lack detail.', '2006-03-24 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254777, 308921, 11800, '<td valign="top">The composition is static. Looks like it was underexposed.</td>', 'The composition is static. Looks like it was underexposed.', '2006-03-24 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254794, 307451, 11800, '<td valign="top">I feel this would be nicer if there was some more light defining her shape. It''s ok and desirable in low key to have areas that highlight shape. This picture could be lightened up quite a bit and still be low key.</td>', 'I feel this would be nicer if there was some more light defining her shape. It''s ok and desirable in low key to have areas that highlight shape. This picture could be lightened up quite a bit and still be low key.', '2006-03-24 12:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254799, 309654, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this composition.</td>', 'I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this composition.', '2006-03-24 12:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254802, 309555, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cropping more at bottom would have help this and not impacted the low-keyness.</td>', 'Cropping more at bottom would have help this and not impacted the low-keyness.', '2006-03-24 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254804, 309900, 16402, '<td valign="top">Composition just doesn''t work for me, sorry. Focus also seems questionable.</td>', 'Composition just doesn''t work for me, sorry. Focus also seems questionable.', '2006-03-24 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254824, 306999, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this photo. <br/>Actually, the necklace is a really good object for trying low key. The intricate shapes could be really stunning with the right light. Try looking at it in different natural light situations beside a window under cloudy conditions and sunny conditions. How does the light emphasize the shape? Hope you try some more compositions with it.</td>', 'I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this photo. Actually, the necklace is a really good object for trying low key. The intricate shapes could be really stunning with the right light. Try looking at it in different natural light situations beside a window under cloudy conditions and sunny conditions. How does the light emphasize the shape? Hope you try some more compositions with it.', '2006-03-24 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254829, 309738, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this photo.</td>', 'I don''t see how the darkness has enhanced this photo.', '2006-03-24 12:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254838, 309650, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really nice job. Think the creative toning really makes it work.</td>', 'Really nice job. Think the creative toning really makes it work.', '2006-03-24 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254839, 309376, 16402, '<td valign="top">Needs a tighter crop at top and right.</td>', 'Needs a tighter crop at top and right.', '2006-03-24 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254843, 309087, 28054, '<td valign="top">I''ve scored this low as it doesn''t shout ''Low key'' to me, also as a landscape shot its a little flat and un-interesting. I''d have tried making this black and white and bumped up the contrast a little.</td>', 'I''ve scored this low as it doesn''t shout ''Low key'' to me, also as a landscape shot its a little flat and un-interesting. I''d have tried making this black and white and bumped up the contrast a little.', '2006-03-24 12:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254851, 309773, 28054, '<td valign="top">The colours of the petals seem a little muted, which doesn''t really strike me as low key. I''d have gone for a simpler shot, maybe just one flower on the black background. Good detail in the petals though.</td>', 'The colours of the petals seem a little muted, which doesn''t really strike me as low key. I''d have gone for a simpler shot, maybe just one flower on the black background. Good detail in the petals though.', '2006-03-24 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254853, 309738, 16402, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what it is sorry.</td>', 'Can''t tell what it is sorry.', '2006-03-24 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254856, 309435, 28054, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast but for me its too bright to be low key. Its still a nice picture tho!</td>', 'Nice contrast but for me its too bright to be low key. Its still a nice picture tho!', '2006-03-24 12:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254857, 309495, 16402, '<td valign="top">It''s low-key but it really doesn''t interest me.</td>', 'It''s low-key but it really doesn''t interest me.', '2006-03-24 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254861, 307792, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how low key was used in this picture. The use of shadows to create a mood is lacking. I think of low key as painting with shadows.</td>', 'I don''t see how low key was used in this picture. The use of shadows to create a mood is lacking. I think of low key as painting with shadows.', '2006-03-24 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254863, 308244, 28054, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - looks like its window lit to me? I like the expression of concentration on the kids face, but I''d have tried to block the light fall-off on the background and possibly on the lower edge of the picture too.</td>', 'Nice lighting - looks like its window lit to me? I like the expression of concentration on the kids face, but I''d have tried to block the light fall-off on the background and possibly on the lower edge of the picture too.', '2006-03-24 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2254864, 309746, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is. It''s not compelling enough to want to discover what it is. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is. It''s not compelling enough to want to discover what it is. Sorry.', '2006-03-24 12:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254871, 308710, 28054, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture with lots going on, but the flat even lighting isn''t my idea of low key. Perhaps getting closer into the table and lighting from one side so that some of the books etc stand out would have made this picture better for me.</td>', 'Interesting picture with lots going on, but the flat even lighting isn''t my idea of low key. Perhaps getting closer into the table and lighting from one side so that some of the books etc stand out would have made this picture better for me.', '2006-03-24 12:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254876, 307954, 28054, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subjet matter and one of the few images which I think meets the ''Low Key'' challenge. I''ll have to check back after voting closes to find out exactly whats going on in the picture tho! ;)</td>', 'Good choice of subjet matter and one of the few images which I think meets the ''Low Key'' challenge. I''ll have to check back after voting closes to find out exactly whats going on in the picture tho! ;)', '2006-03-24 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254880, 309553, 11800, '<td valign="top">Exposed as good as it can be, but I don''t find it interesting.</td>', 'Exposed as good as it can be, but I don''t find it interesting.', '2006-03-24 12:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254886, 308271, 28054, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, obviously well thought out and good tonal range. I''d have cropped in slightly to the knee and head to focus attention and hide the floor in the bottom left corner :)</td>', 'Nice picture, obviously well thought out and good tonal range. I''d have cropped in slightly to the knee and head to focus attention and hide the floor in the bottom left corner :)', '2006-03-24 12:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254887, 309749, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Bit too dark but that could just be my monitor.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Bit too dark but that could just be my monitor.', '2006-03-24 12:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254888, 309598, 16402, '<td valign="top">This needs cropping much tighter. With that said I do think the exposure and focus are excellent.</td>', 'This needs cropping much tighter. With that said I do think the exposure and focus are excellent.', '2006-03-24 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254889, 309560, 28054, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very effective, title adds a bit of a different twist to it too, good one!</td>', 'Very simple but very effective, title adds a bit of a different twist to it too, good one!', '2006-03-24 12:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254891, 309898, 28054, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting picture, I like it :)</td>', 'This is a really interesting picture, I like it :)', '2006-03-24 12:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254892, 307600, 28054, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective, nice.</td>', 'Simple yet effective, nice.', '2006-03-24 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254893, 309883, 19594, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model. Background is a bit confusing.</td>', 'Beautiful model. Background is a bit confusing.', '2006-03-24 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254900, 307206, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the mystery. The issues with the picture are camera shake/lack of focus, the backdrop(love the color/hate the wrinkles) and a lack of definition for the shape of the box. Just a little bounced light to define it from the chair would be nice.</td>', 'I like the mystery. The issues with the picture are camera shake/lack of focus, the backdrop(love the color/hate the wrinkles) and a lack of definition for the shape of the box. Just a little bounced light to define it from the chair would be nice.', '2006-03-24 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254902, 309263, 28054, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, I''d like to see a bit more contrast myself but very good :)</td>', 'Interesting picture, I''d like to see a bit more contrast myself but very good :)', '2006-03-24 12:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254903, 309792, 19594, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know what this is to comment.</td>', 'I don''t even know what this is to comment.', '2006-03-24 12:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254905, 309752, 28054, '<td valign="top">Bizzare but I like it!</td>', 'Bizzare but I like it!', '2006-03-24 12:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254913, 307397, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s not in focus.</td>', 'It''s not in focus.', '2006-03-24 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254919, 307837, 28054, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that the picture was a bit under exposed, but I think it suits the mood of the picture itself and goes to show that sometimes throwing the rules out of the window works, for me anyway.</td>', 'My first impression was that the picture was a bit under exposed, but I think it suits the mood of the picture itself and goes to show that sometimes throwing the rules out of the window works, for me anyway.', '2006-03-24 12:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254922, 309306, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the subject or composition very interesting.</td>', 'I don''t find the subject or composition very interesting.', '2006-03-24 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254928, 307195, 28054, '<td valign="top">A little blurred and arguably not really low key but it certainly suits the title the picture was given.</td>', 'A little blurred and arguably not really low key but it certainly suits the title the picture was given.', '2006-03-24 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254935, 309225, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually against an oof foreground, but in this picture 1/2 of the frame is oof. Would have been better with the background oof.</td>', 'I''m not usually against an oof foreground, but in this picture 1/2 of the frame is oof. Would have been better with the background oof.', '2006-03-24 12:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254938, 308695, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how the darkness enhanced this picture.</td>', 'I don''t see how the darkness enhanced this picture.', '2006-03-24 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254940, 309640, 28054, '<td valign="top">It looks like the picture was over exposed on the cheek, then toned down in post process which to me makes the cheek look wet and a little odd. I''d maybe have stuck with the first version.</td>', 'It looks like the picture was over exposed on the cheek, then toned down in post process which to me makes the cheek look wet and a little odd. I''d maybe have stuck with the first version.', '2006-03-24 12:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254942, 308896, 28054, '<td valign="top">Really unusual looking picture which I think works well, well done.</td>', 'Really unusual looking picture which I think works well, well done.', '2006-03-24 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254962, 308258, 28054, '<td valign="top">This to me is a real low key image doing what low key images are supposed to do; highlighting lines, cureves, texture and tone in the image. Only slight criticism is I''d liked to have seen a little more of the models face. Good job!</td>', 'This to me is a real low key image doing what low key images are supposed to do; highlighting lines, cureves, texture and tone in the image. Only slight criticism is I''d liked to have seen a little more of the models face. Good job!', '2006-03-24 13:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2254971, 309117, 28054, '<td valign="top">A really powerful and well executed picture, well done.</td>', 'A really powerful and well executed picture, well done.', '2006-03-24 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255011, 308276, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, there are a lot of things that could have been avoided when the shot was being set up, like the water spots and lint, that would have helped the presentation. The highlights are a little to bright.</td>', 'To me, there are a lot of things that could have been avoided when the shot was being set up, like the water spots and lint, that would have helped the presentation. The highlights are a little to bright.', '2006-03-24 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255030, 307444, 48890, '<td valign="top">Careful composition, interesting technique. 9</td>', 'Careful composition, interesting technique. 9', '2006-03-24 13:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255032, 309447, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good idea but to dark. It''s ok to have brighter areas to define the shape. It''s not my monitor. I can see her tatoos and her leg. It''s just to low contrast/dark.</td>', 'Good idea but to dark. It''s ok to have brighter areas to define the shape. It''s not my monitor. I can see her tatoos and her leg. It''s just to low contrast/dark.', '2006-03-24 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255044, 308896, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it''s very interesting.</td>', 'I don''t think it''s very interesting.', '2006-03-24 13:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255053, 309086, 28054, '<td valign="top">Really nice but I think just a touch too soft</td>', 'Really nice but I think just a touch too soft', '2006-03-24 13:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255054, 309634, 48890, '<td valign="top">I''d be interested to read about technique used in this shot.  Is reversed?</td>', 'I''d be interested to read about technique used in this shot.  Is reversed?', '2006-03-24 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255060, 308907, 48890, '<td valign="top">This is family album material 3</td>', 'This is family album material 3', '2006-03-24 13:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255071, 309378, 11800, '<td valign="top">The exposure and composition are good. I like this also. It looks like a normal distrubition of light and dark. Low key is more than just a dark picture. It is more about painting with shadows. I just don''t get that feeling with this picture.</td>', 'The exposure and composition are good. I like this also. It looks like a normal distrubition of light and dark. Low key is more than just a dark picture. It is more about painting with shadows. I just don''t get that feeling with this picture.', '2006-03-24 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255076, 308679, 28054, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, especially the look of panic in the eyes (like is perhaps the wrong word tho). Its let down by the blurring though.</td>', 'I like this picture, especially the look of panic in the eyes (like is perhaps the wrong word tho). Its let down by the blurring though.', '2006-03-24 13:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255079, 309599, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this very interresting.</td>', 'I don''t find this very interresting.', '2006-03-24 13:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255081, 309779, 48890, '<td valign="top">I would want a bit more details in the bottom of the frame; or, perhaps, crop the lower 1/5 out. 7</td>', 'I would want a bit more details in the bottom of the frame; or, perhaps, crop the lower 1/5 out. 7', '2006-03-24 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
