(2255109, 308417, 11800, '<td valign="top">If the title was taken away, I wouldn''t know what this was. The lighter parts should help define the shapes. Here they just look random.</td>', 'If the title was taken away, I wouldn''t know what this was. The lighter parts should help define the shapes. Here they just look random.', '2006-03-24 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
