(2255188, 307600, 21197, '<td valign="top">Underexposed, the description of the challenge really throws people off from what low key really is. If you decide to try this photograph again, try properly exposing the keys and maintain the blackest black for the rest.</td>', 'Underexposed, the description of the challenge really throws people off from what low key really is. If you decide to try this photograph again, try properly exposing the keys and maintain the blackest black for the rest.', '2006-03-24 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
