(2255248, 309792, 53964, '<td valign="top">Too minimalistic for my taste. I like the idea, but with a <i>little</i> more crop.</td>', 'Too minimalistic for my taste. I like the idea, but with a little more crop.', '2006-03-24 14:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255253, 309547, 21197, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge maybe?</td>', 'wrong challenge maybe?', '2006-03-24 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255256, 309616, 53964, '<td valign="top">The overbrightness draws the eye away from the beautiful colours and patterns beyond.</td>', 'The overbrightness draws the eye away from the beautiful colours and patterns beyond.', '2006-03-24 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255303, 309729, 53964, '<td valign="top">Good job in getting the contours on the face. Maybe taping some gauze on the back of the shutters would have cut the intensity a bit, given you better control on the light. Also, centering the face diminishes the interest some.  I''m new to this style, and found that it''s certainly not as easy to obtain as it looks!</td>', 'Good job in getting the contours on the face. Maybe taping some gauze on the back of the shutters would have cut the intensity a bit, given you better control on the light. Also, centering the face diminishes the interest some.  I''m new to this style, and found that it''s certainly not as easy to obtain as it looks!', '2006-03-24 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255324, 309859, 13719, '<td valign="top">ahhh...sorry thats first thing that cem to mind.....lol, pretty cool photo though, nice catch with the mouth opened</td>', 'ahhh...sorry thats first thing that cem to mind.....lol, pretty cool photo though, nice catch with the mouth opened', '2006-03-24 14:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255325, 309773, 53964, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of something from an old book. Normally we want to see daffodils pop with brightness but I like this. Personally, I wish I could see a little more of the vase. The lines are so flowing that my eye keeps trying to follow and isn''t allowed to go far. But then we''d lose detail in the flowers if you pulled back, and I like that too. Okay, I guess  that means it''s good, if I want to see more, right?</td>', 'It reminds me of something from an old book. Normally we want to see daffodils pop with brightness but I like this. Personally, I wish I could see a little more of the vase. The lines are so flowing that my eye keeps trying to follow and isn''t allowed to go far. But then we''d lose detail in the flowers if you pulled back, and I like that too. Okay, I guess  that means it''s good, if I want to see more, right?', '2006-03-24 14:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255326, 307974, 13719, '<td valign="top">I love this image, coloring is perfect and love the shadows and how clear the image is.</td>', 'I love this image, coloring is perfect and love the shadows and how clear the image is.', '2006-03-24 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255328, 309632, 13719, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W, awesome clarity, love the amount of whiteness in the photo</td>', 'Beautiful B&W, awesome clarity, love the amount of whiteness in the photo', '2006-03-24 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255329, 309719, 13719, '<td valign="top">hmmmm</td>', 'hmmmm', '2006-03-24 14:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
