(2255361, 309690, 13719, '<td valign="top">Great, the lighting is awesome in this B&amp;W and also the colors or the greys are perfect, I love the hand and the water drops also</td>', 'Great, the lighting is awesome in this B&W and also the colors or the greys are perfect, I love the hand and the water drops also', '2006-03-24 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
