(2255373, 308997, 13719, '<td valign="top">Awesome B&amp;W, the shadows and how dark you decided the greys to be is perfect, makes it a very strong B&amp;W, so far the best of the bunch to me</td>', 'Awesome B&W, the shadows and how dark you decided the greys to be is perfect, makes it a very strong B&W, so far the best of the bunch to me', '2006-03-24 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
