(2255401, 309779, 11800, '<td valign="top">wonderful. Her eyes look like old old ivory. The only nit pick from me is her missing chin and loss of detail for her lips. And that''s only because the rest is so heavily textured.</td>', 'wonderful. Her eyes look like old old ivory. The only nit pick from me is her missing chin and loss of detail for her lips. And that''s only because the rest is so heavily textured.', '2006-03-24 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
