(2255421, 307781, 19944, '<td valign="top">Low key is characterized by few highlights.  There is lots of highlight here.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, his is a very sharp shot with nice DOF.</td>', 'Low key is characterized by few highlights.  There is lots of highlight here. Otherwise, his is a very sharp shot with nice DOF.', '2006-03-24 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
