(2257299, 309895, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is harsh and should have included more of the hand and ciggy. Maybe a little more light under the hat to separate it from the shadow. As it is, the shadow looks like it''s the hat &amp; it''s oof. With softer light and a more nuanced control of it to include more dark tones this could have been stunning.</td>', 'I think the lighting is harsh and should have included more of the hand and ciggy. Maybe a little more light under the hat to separate it from the shadow. As it is, the shadow looks like it''s the hat & it''s oof. With softer light and a more nuanced control of it to include more dark tones this could have been stunning.', '2006-03-25 07:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
