(2257325, 308271, 11800, '<td valign="top">If I had to define this picture by technique, I wouldn''t think low key. The gown is to light in color. I may be wrong but from what I have read, one wouldn''t want that much of an area to be light colored. It''s a nice picture and the only thing I don''t like is the shadow on her chest.</td>', 'If I had to define this picture by technique, I wouldn''t think low key. The gown is to light in color. I may be wrong but from what I have read, one wouldn''t want that much of an area to be light colored. It''s a nice picture and the only thing I don''t like is the shadow on her chest.', '2006-03-25 07:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
