(2259419, 309758, 47573, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, another of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'very nice shot, another of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-03-26 03:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259450, 309312, 50674, '<td valign="top">IMO the colors are too warm for a what is meant to be a cold picture. He seems to be either inside or just outside for 2 minutes. Other than that, I like the composition - good balance.</td>', 'IMO the colors are too warm for a what is meant to be a cold picture. He seems to be either inside or just outside for 2 minutes. Other than that, I like the composition - good balance.', '2006-03-26 04:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259455, 309650, 50674, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there :-) Wonderful composition and colours are excellent, I like the balance and how you caught both stillness; the empty street on the left, and movement; the car that is about to drive away (exhaustion fumes) on the left. Then there is the woman waiting in the middle, about to leave, and the guy on the poster, wanting to play . An absolute fave, well done.</td>', 'I''ve been there :-) Wonderful composition and colours are excellent, I like the balance and how you caught both stillness; the empty street on the left, and movement; the car that is about to drive away (exhaustion fumes) on the left. Then there is the woman waiting in the middle, about to leave, and the guy on the poster, wanting to play . An absolute fave, well done.', '2006-03-26 04:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259543, 307202, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good timing to capture a sunset and there appear to be nice clouds in the scene. The good news is this image is low-key. Low-key refers to the an image that has detail concentrated in the shadows and has little or none in the highlights. However, the effect was achieved by underexposing the image and some voters will say it is not low-key, but just simply underexposed.<br/> <br/>Looks to have a yellow color cast as well. That is common in low-light situations where the camera cannot determine correct white balance. This is correctable in post-processing with most image editors. The sunset was probably much prettier than this.<br/> <br/>Compositionally this image could be stronger. The tower is very small and far away. If you could find a closer foreground object like a tree or building that occupies a larger portion of the frame that would add interest to the composition.</td>', 'Good timing to capture a sunset and there appear to be nice clouds in the scene. The good news is this image is low-key. Low-key refers to the an image that has detail concentrated in the shadows and has little or none in the highlights. However, the effect was achieved by underexposing the image and some voters will say it is not low-key, but just simply underexposed. Looks to have a yellow color cast as well. That is common in low-light situations where the camera cannot determine correct white balance. This is correctable in post-processing with most image editors. The sunset was probably much prettier than this. Compositionally this image could be stronger. The tower is very small and far away. If you could find a closer foreground object like a tree or building that occupies a larger portion of the frame that would add interest to the composition.', '2006-03-26 07:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259587, 309403, 27133, '<td valign="top">Now this is fantastic.  Well done.  10</td>', 'Now this is fantastic.  Well done.  10', '2006-03-26 09:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259589, 307595, 27133, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhhhhhhh....into my favourites...Oh and a 10.</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhhhhhhh....into my favourites...Oh and a 10.', '2006-03-26 09:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2259975, 309895, 33068, '<td valign="top">Very well executed and composed with "sexy" lighting and a beautiful model.  Exceptional!  This should ribbon.</td>', 'Very well executed and composed with "sexy" lighting and a beautiful model.  Exceptional!  This should ribbon.', '2006-03-26 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260122, 309719, 10858, '<td valign="top">I appreciate your sense of humour. :-) Though, this one has really few to do with (quality) photography. (2)</td>', 'I appreciate your sense of humour. :-) Though, this one has really few to do with (quality) photography. (2)', '2006-03-26 15:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260171, 308277, 10858, '<td valign="top">I have seen many violin photos in this challenge, but I like this composition the most. It has lovely warm tones, the bow across the strings gives the photo a lovely element. Good luck!</td>', 'I have seen many violin photos in this challenge, but I like this composition the most. It has lovely warm tones, the bow across the strings gives the photo a lovely element. Good luck!', '2006-03-26 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
