(2260182, 309225, 10858, '<td valign="top">Can''t really figure it out what this is. I miss the shadows, there are too much dominant midtones without dark tones. Ant whatever this is, the 2/3 part o the photo is out of focus.</td>', 'Can''t really figure it out what this is. I miss the shadows, there are too much dominant midtones without dark tones. Ant whatever this is, the 2/3 part o the photo is out of focus.', '2006-03-26 15:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
