(2265076, 309671, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fear of the water park slide ignited. Very interesting.</td>', 'Fear of the water park slide ignited. Very interesting.', '2006-03-27 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265077, 307756, 40370, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.</td>', 'Powerful image.', '2006-03-27 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265085, 309263, 40370, '<td valign="top">Looks like a few of the corners in my house ... ahhhh. But I do enjoy the simplicity of this image, the light is just right to highlight the cobwebs.</td>', 'Looks like a few of the corners in my house ... ahhhh. But I do enjoy the simplicity of this image, the light is just right to highlight the cobwebs.', '2006-03-27 23:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265090, 309403, 40370, '<td valign="top">Love the shadows created on this very nice back. I realize the position of the model was well thought out but would be curious to see just the back of his head alone, without the hands, (the way I) perceived size and coloring are a distraction in a fantastic body image.</td>', 'Love the shadows created on this very nice back. I realize the position of the model was well thought out but would be curious to see just the back of his head alone, without the hands, (the way I) perceived size and coloring are a distraction in a fantastic body image.', '2006-03-27 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265091, 309845, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too underexposed.</td>', 'This is a bit too underexposed.', '2006-03-27 23:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265094, 307102, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject for this challenge and good job of not getting too-bright reflections!</td>', 'Nice choice of subject for this challenge and good job of not getting too-bright reflections!', '2006-03-27 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265098, 307940, 30982, '<td valign="top">Presents as a very peaceful image.</td>', 'Presents as a very peaceful image.', '2006-03-27 23:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265101, 309543, 30982, '<td valign="top">The topmost leaves are just a little blown but the overall composition is very nice in its simplicity.</td>', 'The topmost leaves are just a little blown but the overall composition is very nice in its simplicity.', '2006-03-27 23:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265106, 308427, 30982, '<td valign="top">The top two lights distract a bit from this otherwise lovely image - nice detail, very good lighting on the pipes.</td>', 'The top two lights distract a bit from this otherwise lovely image - nice detail, very good lighting on the pipes.', '2006-03-27 23:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265111, 308039, 30982, '<td valign="top">I recognize this typewriter... larryslights, right?  The one highlight on the chrome on the top is the only nit I have with this.  Otherwise I quite like it.</td>', 'I recognize this typewriter... larryslights, right?  The one highlight on the chrome on the top is the only nit I have with this.  Otherwise I quite like it.', '2006-03-27 23:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265119, 308706, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the texture brought out by the lighting and the water - not sure I like the line on the ball going straight up the middle.</td>', 'I love the texture brought out by the lighting and the water - not sure I like the line on the ball going straight up the middle.', '2006-03-27 23:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265129, 309512, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the shape of the pose - might have liked just a bit more light on her legs and feet.</td>', 'I like the shape of the pose - might have liked just a bit more light on her legs and feet.', '2006-03-27 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265142, 307283, 40370, '<td valign="top">Very cool DOF through the trees, I would have rotated image to straighten out either the closer bench or basketball standard, also cropped out the branch bottom left.</td>', 'Very cool DOF through the trees, I would have rotated image to straighten out either the closer bench or basketball standard, also cropped out the branch bottom left.', '2006-03-27 23:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265145, 308661, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2006-03-27 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265146, 309645, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture - oh to have it just a bit bigger!</td>', 'A lovely picture - oh to have it just a bit bigger!', '2006-03-27 23:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265150, 307846, 40370, '<td valign="top">Was the idle really that steady in RPM''s for this fantastic clarity? Nice shot.</td>', 'Was the idle really that steady in RPM''s for this fantastic clarity? Nice shot.', '2006-03-27 23:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265155, 307781, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not low key, but an interesting picture!</td>', 'Not low key, but an interesting picture!', '2006-03-27 23:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265163, 309403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of ligh and shadow!</td>', 'Nice use of ligh and shadow!', '2006-03-27 23:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265182, 307685, 30982, '<td valign="top">This appears to be handheld at slow shutter which introduced some movement to the shot.</td>', 'This appears to be handheld at slow shutter which introduced some movement to the shot.', '2006-03-27 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265189, 308917, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective!</td>', 'Interesting perspective!', '2006-03-27 23:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265194, 309891, 30982, '<td valign="top">The shell is very nicely lit for low key - I''d have liked it better with just the shell alone, I think.</td>', 'The shell is very nicely lit for low key - I''d have liked it better with just the shell alone, I think.', '2006-03-27 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265202, 308905, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good low key lighting.  Kinda odd subject.  :-)</td>', 'Good low key lighting.  Kinda odd subject.  :-)', '2006-03-28 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265205, 307268, 40370, '<td valign="top">I love how the thorny projections are caught in the light. Great choice of subject but just needs a little more "pop", maybe a little more light would have allowed better focus.</td>', 'I love how the thorny projections are caught in the light. Great choice of subject but just needs a little more "pop", maybe a little more light would have allowed better focus.', '2006-03-28 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265216, 309019, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot, I am definitely a beginner at "low key", don''t know if the bright sky belongs, but this is fantastic. The composition and DOF are wonderful and of course B&amp;W is essential. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this image a lot, I am definitely a beginner at "low key", don''t know if the bright sky belongs, but this is fantastic. The composition and DOF are wonderful and of course B&W is essential. Good luck.', '2006-03-28 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265227, 308874, 40370, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking ... the fine lines you''ve captured on the horse are beautiful.</td>', 'Breathtaking ... the fine lines you''ve captured on the horse are beautiful.', '2006-03-28 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265229, 309301, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely angle of the face in the frame - I really like that as well as the expression.  But the movement of either the child or the camera creates a blur that''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Lovely angle of the face in the frame - I really like that as well as the expression.  But the movement of either the child or the camera creates a blur that''s a bit distracting.', '2006-03-28 00:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265233, 307781, 40370, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about low key but you''ve got fine focus and a different subject.</td>', 'Don''t know about low key but you''ve got fine focus and a different subject.', '2006-03-28 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265235, 309840, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot of the pier, with the clouds balancing out the structure well, but I just don''t see it as low key.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot of the pier, with the clouds balancing out the structure well, but I just don''t see it as low key.', '2006-03-28 00:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265237, 309452, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as low key.</td>', 'I don''t see this as low key.', '2006-03-28 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265242, 309616, 40370, '<td valign="top">Left side too harsh. Interesting location though. Crop the bright next time.</td>', 'Left side too harsh. Interesting location though. Crop the bright next time.', '2006-03-28 00:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265260, 307798, 40370, '<td valign="top">Snow covered mountains ... interesting choice for "low key", very nice image regarding composition and focus, wonder what it looks like without the post-processing.</td>', 'Snow covered mountains ... interesting choice for "low key", very nice image regarding composition and focus, wonder what it looks like without the post-processing.', '2006-03-28 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265266, 309136, 40370, '<td valign="top">"blue key" makes this image stand out in this challenge</td>', '"blue key" makes this image stand out in this challenge', '2006-03-28 00:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265321, 309337, 40370, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the red tones in the image, especially after so many stark B&amp;W in this challenge, but I am giving extra thought to this portrait.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the red tones in the image, especially after so many stark B&W in this challenge, but I am giving extra thought to this portrait.', '2006-03-28 00:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265327, 309749, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, an athlete at her best, you''re fortunate for such a great model, very nice capture for low key.</td>', 'Wow, an athlete at her best, you''re fortunate for such a great model, very nice capture for low key.', '2006-03-28 00:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265341, 307792, 40370, '<td valign="top">Great location and subject to shoot, but this image seems hampered by too much green and/or yellow hue.</td>', 'Great location and subject to shoot, but this image seems hampered by too much green and/or yellow hue.', '2006-03-28 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265396, 307943, 40370, '<td valign="top">Saw this early in voting, have come back to bump as it is one of my favorites.</td>', 'Saw this early in voting, have come back to bump as it is one of my favorites.', '2006-03-28 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265397, 308421, 40370, '<td valign="top">This portrait fills the frame in an extraordinary way. Top five of the portraits.</td>', 'This portrait fills the frame in an extraordinary way. Top five of the portraits.', '2006-03-28 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1);
