(2265732, 309836, 3746, '<td valign="top">almost a very good photo. Would of been better if you had managed to `black out` the background totally so only the flowers were in view.. And then maybe had more `delicate` lighting on them, so the edges of the petal were more prominant than the whole thing.. nice try - 6</td>', 'almost a very good photo. Would of been better if you had managed to `black out` the background totally so only the flowers were in view.. And then maybe had more `delicate` lighting on them, so the edges of the petal were more prominant than the whole thing.. nice try - 6', '2006-03-28 07:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
