(2265740, 309891, 3746, '<td valign="top">This would of worked a lot better with just the shell on its own. I am thinking that you have had a number of people say that already. Really, slightly deeper DOF and just the shell would of earned this an 8. However the flower is REALLLY distracting and lowers this to an average 5.. good try.</td>', 'This would of worked a lot better with just the shell on its own. I am thinking that you have had a number of people say that already. Really, slightly deeper DOF and just the shell would of earned this an 8. However the flower is REALLLY distracting and lowers this to an average 5.. good try.', '2006-03-28 07:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
