(2265791, 308158, 3746, '<td valign="top">You hit the challenge on the head with this one (in terms of lighting/composition etc), however it seems everything has a tiny bit of blur (possibly handshake?). This detracts from the overall feel of the image. However, in a challenge where the majority of people have misinterpreted `low-key` as `underexposed`, this stands out. I am not going to lie and say you will ribbon with this image, but I wouldnt be surprised to see you in the top 20. Which in a challenge with over 200 entries, is something to be pleased about. Well done.</td>', 'You hit the challenge on the head with this one (in terms of lighting/composition etc), however it seems everything has a tiny bit of blur (possibly handshake?). This detracts from the overall feel of the image. However, in a challenge where the majority of people have misinterpreted `low-key` as `underexposed`, this stands out. I am not going to lie and say you will ribbon with this image, but I wouldnt be surprised to see you in the top 20. Which in a challenge with over 200 entries, is something to be pleased about. Well done.', '2006-03-28 07:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265795, 309512, 3746, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. nailed the challenge with this one. I predict top 10.</td>', 'Brilliant. nailed the challenge with this one. I predict top 10.', '2006-03-28 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
