(2268662, 307448, 43434, '<td valign="top">Hi<br/> <br/>I really like this image, but it doesn''t meet the challenge .. in that it is high key.  But you are making some really good moves in developing your skills as a photographer .. and should keep it up ... I can''t wait to see how you develop further.<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', 'Hi I really like this image, but it doesn''t meet the challenge .. in that it is high key.  But you are making some really good moves in developing your skills as a photographer .. and should keep it up ... I can''t wait to see how you develop further. Kari', '2006-03-29 03:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
