(2269515, 308144, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of my top three choices for a ribbon winner in this challenge. Sorry you did not get it this time but you will win a ribbon soon. You are a fantastic photographer! Tones are the hallmark of a great low-key image and this image certainly has that. It is a very unique and fabulous composition.</td>', 'One of my top three choices for a ribbon winner in this challenge. Sorry you did not get it this time but you will win a ribbon soon. You are a fantastic photographer! Tones are the hallmark of a great low-key image and this image certainly has that. It is a very unique and fabulous composition.', '2006-03-29 10:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
