(2269552, 309312, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top three choices for a ribbon in this challenge. Simply put, it is a perfect color, low-key image. The detail in the shadows is outstanding and the technical quality of the image superb.  I''m disappointed to see it finish so low. It''s subtlety went unrecognized by voters.</td>', 'This is one of my top three choices for a ribbon in this challenge. Simply put, it is a perfect color, low-key image. The detail in the shadows is outstanding and the technical quality of the image superb.  I''m disappointed to see it finish so low. It''s subtlety went unrecognized by voters.', '2006-03-29 11:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
