(2270072, 308090, 7778, '<td valign="top">All in all, I''d agree with stdavidson: a worth-while image. The dusty shaft of light is particularly <i>live</i> and dynamic. I''m a little less content with the discernible Neat Image effects (edges of ceiling boards and support strut), especially in combination with sharpening (see the haloed outline of the photographer on the left).</td>', 'All in all, I''d agree with stdavidson: a worth-while image. The dusty shaft of light is particularly live and dynamic. I''m a little less content with the discernible Neat Image effects (edges of ceiling boards and support strut), especially in combination with sharpening (see the haloed outline of the photographer on the left).', '2006-03-29 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 0),
