(2272335, 308671, 27431, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Bear. Without being judgemental,I can see why some would have a hard time buying the low key aspect of this shot. There is a bit more light and shadow detail than I would think would be commonly acceptable. Having said that, it has some great shadow detail, and for an old sea dog like me, is very calming and restful, reminding me of cool mornings spent with a cup of coffee and a quiet harbor before the start of a hectic day. Kind of the deep breath before starting work. Let me know if you are going to do a print version.</td>', 'Very nice, Bear. Without being judgemental,I can see why some would have a hard time buying the low key aspect of this shot. There is a bit more light and shadow detail than I would think would be commonly acceptable. Having said that, it has some great shadow detail, and for an old sea dog like me, is very calming and restful, reminding me of cool mornings spent with a cup of coffee and a quiet harbor before the start of a hectic day. Kind of the deep breath before starting work. Let me know if you are going to do a print version.', '2006-03-30 02:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2272343, 309632, 9906, '<td valign="top">Been so busy that this is the first that I saw this.  Kudos on the blue!  Well deserved.  Awesomely simple shot.<br/>Yours<br/>TC</td>', 'Been so busy that this is the first that I saw this.  Kudos on the blue!  Well deserved.  Awesomely simple shot.YoursTC', '2006-03-30 02:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2272351, 307365, 42013, '<td valign="top">This is neat, I like the warmth and feeling of nostalgia in this photo. Composition and cropping are ideal for the subject.</td>', 'This is neat, I like the warmth and feeling of nostalgia in this photo. Composition and cropping are ideal for the subject.', '2006-03-30 02:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2272507, 309225, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Claya:</b></div><hr/><i> Think focus at front would have worked better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree, my Oly does a lousy job selecively focusing on the foreground, and I have no manual focus option -- macros are always a challenge.<br/> <br/>For those who thought it was just dirt, these are earthworm "castings" or excreta -- one of the most important components in the constant recycling of nutrients. I believe it is estimated that most of the topsoil found in the world today has passed through the intestines of at least one earthworm ...</td>', 'Originally posted by Claya: Think focus at front would have worked better.  I agree, my Oly does a lousy job selecively focusing on the foreground, and I have no manual focus option -- macros are always a challenge. For those who thought it was just dirt, these are earthworm "castings" or excreta -- one of the most important components in the constant recycling of nutrients. I believe it is estimated that most of the topsoil found in the world today has passed through the intestines of at least one earthworm ...', '2006-03-30 04:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
