(2292974, 308273, 15711, '<td valign="top">So lovely. I''m surprised I didn''t comment during the challenge, but 276 is a daunting number.<br/> <br/>Really beautiful and the hands of the ballerina in the center, really makes the shot for me. It epitomizes the elegance and poise of the dancer, not only with her legs and feet, but arms, hands and entire body. Congrats on top 10.</td>', 'So lovely. I''m surprised I didn''t comment during the challenge, but 276 is a daunting number. Really beautiful and the hands of the ballerina in the center, really makes the shot for me. It epitomizes the elegance and poise of the dancer, not only with her legs and feet, but arms, hands and entire body. Congrats on top 10.', '2006-04-06 22:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
