(3406309, 308258, 66310, '<td valign="top">Looking back at some low key entries and this one really stuck out....for obvious reasons. Excellent magagement of light, and the red really draws the viewer in. but mostly.......you get to be with her every night? some guys get all the luck   ;-)</td>', 'Looking back at some low key entries and this one really stuck out....for obvious reasons. Excellent magagement of light, and the red really draws the viewer in. but mostly.......you get to be with her every night? some guys get all the luck   ;-)', '2007-02-26 12:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3505257, 309654, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, at least your featured photo is pleasant to look at and pretty.   I want to GAG every time I look at mine!   YIKES!<br/> <br/>I still think this is lovely :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well, at least your featured photo is pleasant to look at and pretty.   I want to GAG every time I look at mine!   YIKES! I still think this is lovely :) ', '2007-04-01 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3520726, 309654, 67145, '<td valign="top">just noticed the thread ''got a featured photo'' .. cant work out if its sposed to be your worst foto or worst score ... well wotever .. you got a totally crap score on this one shez, but i really like the image .... i personally feel it should''v done heaps better in the challenge .... if i got $1 for every time i said that i''d be a millionaire ... well not quite yet, but i''m working on it!!!!!!</td>', 'just noticed the thread ''got a featured photo'' .. cant work out if its sposed to be your worst foto or worst score ... well wotever .. you got a totally crap score on this one shez, but i really like the image .... i personally feel it should''v done heaps better in the challenge .... if i got $1 for every time i said that i''d be a millionaire ... well not quite yet, but i''m working on it!!!!!!', '2007-04-04 23:06:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3616791, 308258, 78048, '<td valign="top">If only shoot from waist and down, it would be a better picture. The knee is such a great piece</td>', 'If only shoot from waist and down, it would be a better picture. The knee is such a great piece', '2007-05-05 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 0),
