(3966158, 309640, 53278, '<td valign="top">althought the shot is a low key shot, it does not have any reaction from me when i look at it, maybe if there was more light on the eye of the model , that shot would have done better.<br/>on top of it the light reflection ont he right side of the face create a harsh spot instead of being evenly diffused over the whole face.</td>', 'althought the shot is a low key shot, it does not have any reaction from me when i look at it, maybe if there was more light on the eye of the model , that shot would have done better.on top of it the light reflection ont he right side of the face create a harsh spot instead of being evenly diffused over the whole face.', '2007-08-03 15:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4058301, 309019, 83623, '<td valign="top">wow this is just amazing! Th black and whites work wonderfully!</td>', 'wow this is just amazing! Th black and whites work wonderfully!', '2007-09-04 21:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4058628, 309019, 66193, '<td valign="top">what drew me to this photo was the texture in the foreground, and the way the  squares of light keep getting lighter as they get to the window.  Great composition here.  Excellent work!</td>', 'what drew me to this photo was the texture in the foreground, and the way the  squares of light keep getting lighter as they get to the window.  Great composition here.  Excellent work!', '2007-09-04 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090381, 309400, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love this image! The way the highlights are all you see, hidden amongst the shadows, is just exquisite. The contrast is splendid, too. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'I love this image! The way the highlights are all you see, hidden amongst the shadows, is just exquisite. The contrast is splendid, too. Wonderful shot!', '2007-09-14 17:42:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4108836, 308619, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, this is gorgeous. I gave it an 8 at the time. I underrated it!</td>', 'wow, this is gorgeous. I gave it an 8 at the time. I underrated it!', '2007-09-22 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
