(4333128, 309927, 63269, '<td valign="top">One of my goals this year was to make 3,000 comments. This is that last comment. I searched around to find a photo that I really liked, one that would just floor me. This is such a shot. :)<br/> <br/>I love the low key here - it''s intense and subtle. The details are brought out with cunning delicacy... evoking a dark, moody, and even dangerous feeling atmosphere. Superb shot.</td>', 'One of my goals this year was to make 3,000 comments. This is that last comment. I searched around to find a photo that I really liked, one that would just floor me. This is such a shot. :) I love the low key here - it''s intense and subtle. The details are brought out with cunning delicacy... evoking a dark, moody, and even dangerous feeling atmosphere. Superb shot.', '2007-12-24 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
